{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an alien onslaught in Zaxoid, an adrenaline inducing, roguelite twin-stick space shooter! Defend the galaxy from relentless invaders by upgrading your ship or fortifying your city with strategic choices that make every run unique. Wield dual joysticks for precision chaos, transform into tank mode to repel surface invasions, and protect your population. Intense gameplay that takes you back to the golden years of gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>demo version</strong> gives you a taste of the action with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 playable characters</strong> \u2013 each with their own style and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 planet to defend</strong> \u2013 where you\u2019ll put both ship and tank modes to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core roguelite loop</strong> \u2013 upgrade your ship, build defenses, and survive the onslaught</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012420/extras/1da5a13d62709dbfdc9f1efff1381c73.avif?t=1757637107\" width=565 height=225 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your gamepad for intense, precision combat and a true arcade vibe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012420/extras/617fa6f6dca7df6cef0fe05d6b2e0160.avif?t=1757637107\" width=565 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score epic upgrades for your ship and city, crafting a unique build every run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/